@page "/about"
<PageTitle>About | ShoppetCare</PageTitle>
<main class="owner-shell"><header class="owner-header"><span class="owner-eyebrow">CARE · CONNECTION · SECOND CHANCES</span><h1>Built around the bond you share.</h1><p>ShoppetCare brings pet care, community, and pre-loved shopping together across Web and Mobile.</p></header><div class="owner-grid"><section class="owner-card"><h2>Everyday care</h2><p>Keep pet profiles, health records, medication progress, feeding routines, contacts, and personal vet reminders in one connected account.</p><a href="/my-pets">Explore My Pets →</a></section><section class="owner-card"><h2>Good finds, second lives</h2><p>Every Pet Owner can buy and sell pre-loved pet essentials. Messages help you ask questions and arrange an exchange.</p><a href="/marketplace">Explore Marketplace →</a></section><section class="owner-card"><h2>A community for pet people</h2><p>Share stories and photos, celebrate milestones, and join conversations with comments, replies, and likes.</p><a href="/community">Explore Community →</a></section><section class="owner-card"><h2>Privacy you control</h2><p>Public Pet IDs protect private health information. Sharing your phone number and marketplace social profiles is your choice.</p><a href="/account/care">Manage sharing →</a></section></div><p>ShoppetCare is an academic e-commerce project. Payments and Premium upgrades are simulated; no real funds are charged.</p><a class="owner-button" href="/register">Create a free account</a></main>
